  "body_human_readable": "## Weather in Kyiv: Cloudy with a Chance of Showers\n\n**Kyiv, Ukraine** - The weather in Kyiv today, April 24, 2026, is currently cloudy with a temperature of around 7-8\u00b0C (45\u00b0F). The \"feels like\" temperature is colder, at approximately 4-5\u00b0C (35-40\u00b0F).\n\nThere is a possibility of showers throughout the day, with some sources indicating a 10% chance of rain this morning and afternoon. The humidity is currently around 38-48%. Winds are coming from the west-northwest at about 16 mph (26 km/h).\n\nThe outlook for the rest of the day suggests continued cloudiness with a chance of light rain. The high for today is expected to be around 10-11\u00b0C (50-51\u00b0F) and the low is forecasted to be 3\u00b0C (37\u00b0F). The UV index is low.",
